        "severity": "root-cause",
        "note": "call reserves ++sequence and pending[id] before host.call accepts the serialized object. An argument object with toJSON returning null passes the object/string checks but WorkerBridge.parseCall rejects JsonNull. If the script catches that error and calls a valid tool, its first emitted id is 2 while CodeModeFrames.parseCalls requires 1, poisoning the cell. Validate decoded object before reservation and make reservation atomic with acceptance.",
        "scenario": "try { await tools.Read({toJSON(){return null;}}); } catch {} text(await tools.Read({path:'good'}));"
